        {
          "text": "Nipo Yoswa ŵatite kuti, “Ligongo cici m'mwejo mtujigalile uwe yisawusyo? AMBUJE sambano tacimjigalila m'mwejo yisawusyoyi!” Myoyo ŵandu wosope ŵene ŵamsomile Akani ni maganga mpaka kuwa; ŵalisomile soni liŵasa lyakwe ni kuyijoca yindu yawo yosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.25",
